      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f170b29c-338f-4ab8-a5c4-f72c90826f69",
      "key": "d65b138c-c7ab-4e12-add2-aa59c25c2ceb",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "ab7c8190-9001-40f2-949b-3bce61afd161",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "6dafae2c-a8f1-4a69-9c6a-f3542a2f1558",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E8 day cruise aboard MS Fern\u00E3o de Magalh\u00E3es\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll meals on board included\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome cocktail\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGala dinner \u0026amp; evening\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDrinks included with meals \u0026amp; at the bar\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Porto\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAirport coach transfers to/from the ship\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne free place per 15 paying passengers\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "3fe6efe8-0f48-4ffd-bd84-8c963fc19f4a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESeven nights on full board basis on the MS Fern\u00E3o de Magalh\u00E3es, an intimate-sized standard ship, measuring 75 metres long and 11.40 metres wide. It can accommodate 138 passengers, in 71 cabins spread over three decks. The ship has a lounge, bar, restaurant and a swimming pool and sundeck. The price is based on cabins on the main deck. All cabins have en suite shower and WC, and are equipped with TV, Wi- Fi, safe and air conditioning.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "80e157d7-0323-4dd1-953f-57fa9e6e51bd",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Porto\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWine tasting at Vila Nova de Ga\u00EFa\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVila R\u00E9al\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESalamanca\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPorto Wine Route \u0026amp; wine tasting\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Lamego\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAveiro\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "88a8d7dd-7f50-426d-bf62-6c3bde84a172",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "e7cdf267-02b0-48dd-a3b3-0f979f7dd3bc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 UK to Porto\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Porto from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer in our private executive coach to the MS Fern\u00E3o de Magalh\u00E3es which we board at 17:00.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Porto \u0026amp; wine tasting at Vila Nova de Ga\u00EFa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESail from Porto to Regua\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Vila R\u00E9al\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESail from Regua to Pinhao and on to Vega de Terron. An evening of Flamenco entertainment.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Salamanca\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESail from Vega de Terron to Barca d\u2019Alva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Porto Wine Route \u0026amp; wine tasting\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESail from Barca d\u2019Alva to Ferradosa and on to Pinhao. Tonight enjoy the gala evening and dinner.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Guided tour of Lamego\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESail from Pinhao to Porto. An evening of Fado entertainment.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Aveiro\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn evening of traditional folk entertainment.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Porto\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEnjoy one last buffet breakfast on board before disembarking at 09:00 \u2013 transfer to Porto Airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "0bbf5beb-4642-4e02-baf8-5bc58d2cf02e",
